 of system crashes and data corruption. It’s engineered to deliver reliability and stability under heavy workloads, making it ideal for mission-critical servers, databases, and high-performance applications.</div><div><br></div><div>The Micron MTA18ASF1G72PZ-2G1A2II memory module operates at PC4-2133P speeds, ensuring fast data processing and efficient system performance. With 1Rx4 configuration and Registered DIMM (RDIMM) architecture, this memory is optimized for multi-processor server environments, offering scalability and smooth performance in demanding IT infrastructures.</div><div><br></div><h3>Key Features:</h3><div>8GB capacity for enhanced multitasking and faster data handling in servers</div><div>1Rx4 configuration for increased bandwidth and efficient data flow</div><div>PC4-2133P speed for fast and reliable server performance</div><div>ECC (Error-Correcting Code) support to minimize data corruption and system errors</div><div>Registered DIMM (RDIMM) for improved scalability and stability in multi-processor setups</div><div>Compatible with leading server brands like Dell, HP, and Lenovo</div><div><br></div><div>Ideal for virtualization, cloud computing, and enterprise databases</div>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\